    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678">

                <pb facs="0710" n="612" xml:id="pg612"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11/1613: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-05T11:00:00+08:00">March 5, 1932—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 5—8:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 68, March 2, 5 p.m. British Minister has thus far received no instructions
                    regarding Boxer Indemnity. Italian Chargé d’Affaires informs me that at the
                    request of Soong he has asked his Government to reconsider their position. I
                    shall refrain from saying anything to Soong unless pressed further or hear
                    further from British.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
